direction: right
ingestion: Event validation
possession: Possession ownership
transition: Explicit turnover
shot: Shot detection
insight: Evidence-backed tactical insight
reject: Reject invalid input

ingestion -> possession: valid ordered event
ingestion -> reject: unknown team / duplicate / out of order
possession -> transition: possession changes only with TURNOVER
transition -> shot: carry / pass / shot within time window
shot -> insight: classify pressure or counterattack
possession -> shot: no turnover = no transition insight
